    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "Reunite two freshly dead zombies as you scour the globe in search of the only thing that matters after the apocalypse, your beloved pets. With a whimsical, light-hearted approach to the zombie genre, Love is Dead is a fun and funny puzzle game for everyone that believes true love lasts forever... even beyond the grave. <br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Successor to the hit 'i saw her' web game series.<br></li><li>Play in single player or local co-op, for those with a friend or sweetie.<br></li><li> Find secrets and collectibles in a world brimming with discovery.<br></li><li>Beautifully bouncy art and music.</li></ul><br><br>Designed by <strong>Nick Yonge</strong> of <strong>Curiobot</strong>, creator of the <i>i saw her</i> series. <br><br>Narration by <strong>Elspeth Eastman</strong> <i>(League of Legends, Dead Island: Epidemic, Crypt of the NecroDancer, Torment: Tides of Numenera)</i><br>with additional voices by <strong>Markus Spodzieja</strong> and <strong>Chad Knick</strong><br><br>Original soundtrack by <strong>dloot</strong> <i>(Coin Crypt, Sentry Knight 2)</i><br><br>with 2D art by <strong>Kateh May</strong>, and a 3D art team of <strong>Chris Vasquez</strong>, <strong>Xavier Garcia</strong>, and <strong>Fi Silva</strong> (3D talent behind <i>Injustice 2, Mortal Kombat X, 100ft Robot Golf, Skullgirls, Steambirds: Alliance, Tasty Town, Heroes: Islands of Adventure,</i> and others)",
    "about_the_game": "Reunite two freshly dead zombies as you scour the globe in search of the only thing that matters after the apocalypse, your beloved pets. With a whimsical, light-hearted approach to the zombie genre, Love is Dead is a fun and funny puzzle game for everyone that believes true love lasts forever... even beyond the grave. <br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Successor to the hit 'i saw her' web game series.<br></li><li>Play in single player or local co-op, for those with a friend or sweetie.<br></li><li> Find secrets and collectibles in a world brimming with discovery.<br></li><li>Beautifully bouncy art and music.</li></ul><br><br>Designed by <strong>Nick Yonge</strong> of <strong>Curiobot</strong>, creator of the <i>i saw her</i> series. <br><br>Narration by <strong>Elspeth Eastman</strong> <i>(League of Legends, Dead Island: Epidemic, Crypt of the NecroDancer, Torment: Tides of Numenera)</i><br>with additional voices by <strong>Markus Spodzieja</strong> and <strong>Chad Knick</strong><br><br>Original soundtrack by <strong>dloot</strong> <i>(Coin Crypt, Sentry Knight 2)</i><br><br>with 2D art by <strong>Kateh May</strong>, and a 3D art team of <strong>Chris Vasquez</strong>, <strong>Xavier Garcia</strong>, and <strong>Fi Silva</strong> (3D talent behind <i>Injustice 2, Mortal Kombat X, 100ft Robot Golf, Skullgirls, Steambirds: Alliance, Tasty Town, Heroes: Islands of Adventure,</i> and others)",
    "short_description": "Being a zombie isn't easy. At least your love is a zombie too. Adventure together around the world and solve puzzles, evade ghosts, eat humans and fight pirates. (Who are also humans, I guess...), all to find your beloved pets.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cA long lived and enjoyable puzzler packed into a quirky love story with two zombies at the center of it all. This game contains a staggering amount of creativity and variety with almost no barriers for entry.\u201d<br>8.0 \u2013 Handsome Phantom<br><br>\u201c...An absolute delight to play through.\u201d<br>8.0 \u2013 Pet Wolf Gaming<br><br>\u201cit weaves a hopeful story of connections that can't be broken by anything.\u201d<br>Indie Games The Weblog<br>",
